BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Being One Center Lancaster
UID:event_316174552@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260905T041711Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260907T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260907T210000
SUMMARY:Energy Healing Hour with Anna
DESCRIPTION:Being One Center in Lancaster County\nJoin Anna for a relaxing
  hour of energy healing\, releasing Energy Blockages\, and Reinvigorate yo
 ur chakras.\n\nEveryone needs to take more time self-care in these transfo
 rmational times! Gift yourself one hour to let go and receive.\n\nEnergy h
 ealing will occur when you open yourself to receiving the loving energy of
  the universe from your Oneness Consciousness.\n\nEveryone who is attendin
 g will receive a remote energy healing transmission and experience a guide
 d meditation.\n\nThis Event is lovingly hosted By Anna Bojczuk— a Regist
 ered nurse with over 40 years of experience and a gifted Energy worker. An
 na is also a long-time volunteer and inspiration in the Being One Center C
 ommunity.\n\nSuggested Donation $10\nTo Donate Visit: www.beingonecenter.o
 rg/support
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/beingonecenterlancaster/events/316174
 552/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260818T232002Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260818T232002Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Being One Center Lancaster
UID:event_316274231@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260905T041711Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260914T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260914T210000
SUMMARY:Being One Online Spiritual Support Group
DESCRIPTION:Being One Center in Lancaster County\nLife can be frustrating 
 and distressing!\nSometimes we just feel overwhelmed\, insecure\, or lost!
 \n\nThe good news is\, you're not alone!\n\nWe warmly invite you to check-
 in and connect with community in our Online Spiritual Support Group. In ea
 ch meeting\, we will discuss our current stressors and see how we can posi
 tively cope using our spiritual tools to overcome these challenges.\n\nTog
 ether we can help each other grow and expand our consciousness for these h
 igh vibrational times.\n\nDonations Greatly Appreciated!\n\nThis Event is 
 lovingly hosted By Anna Bojczuk. Anna is a Registered nurse with over 40 y
 ears of experience as well as a gifted Energy worker. Anna is also long-ti
 me volunteer and inspiration in the Being One Center Community.\n\nDonatio
 ns to the Being One Center are greatly appreciated\n(https://www.paypal.co
 m/donate?token=AzIxMnj72R-pxLPP0cGQILM7OPiZs5zbsOdxGA7LFH60Wkr_0YcLATVAkIH
 YVjrFl4PP36X2GkDEJbaM)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/beingonecenterlancaster/events/316274
 231/
